# OpenIntelligence: Gemini rules live in GEMINI.md

Read GEMINI.md, then AGENTS.md. Antigravity's always-on rules are in .agents/rules/.

This file used to hold a separate rule set. By 2026-09-24 it contradicted the current rules in
four places (Xcode 27 beta, changelog section, roadmap lookup, a "Shipped" status that does not
exist), so it was reduced to this pointer. The previous text is kept at
Docs/Archive/geminirules_superseded_2026-09-24.md.
